---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import photo1 from '@/assets/images/individuals/why-join-1.png';
import photo2 from '@/assets/images/individuals/why-join-2.png';
---

<section class="relative z-20 overflow-x-clip py-15 md:py-30" aria-labelledby="why-join-heading">
  <div class="container flex flex-col items-center gap-15 xl:flex-row xl:justify-between xl:gap-27.5">
    <div class="relative h-105 w-full max-w-152 shrink-0 xl:h-131">
      <div class="bg-cream absolute top-1/2 left-0 w-56 -translate-y-1/2 -rotate-10 rounded-sm px-3 pt-3 pb-15 shadow-[0px_4px_7.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.2)] md:w-81">
        <Image src={photo1} alt="A mission team member smiling with local kids" widths={[600]} class="aspect-square w-full rounded-sm object-cover" />
      </div>
      <div class="bg-cream absolute top-1/2 right-0 w-56 -translate-y-1/3 rotate-6 rounded-sm px-3 pt-3 pb-15 shadow-[0px_4px_7.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.2)] md:w-81">
        <Image src={photo2} alt="Volunteers posing together in the field" widths={[600]} class="aspect-square w-full rounded-sm object-cover" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex max-w-164 flex-col gap-7.5 text-center xl:text-left">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3.75">
        <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-none font-bold uppercase">Why Join?</p>
        <h2 id="why-join-heading" class="text-3xl font-bold md:text-5xl">Find Your Place on the Team</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="max-w-130 leading-none">
        Mission isn’t only for groups. Crew419 gives individuals the opportunity to step into meaningful service, build lifelong connections, and use their gifts to share hope through sports and
        ministry.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
